  "slug": "hot-mocha",
  "name": "Hot Mocha",
  "recipe_type": "breakfast",
  "brief_description": "Discover how to make this hot mocha recipe that uses skim milk to make a deceptively lean, yet rich topping and can be enjoyed anytime of the day.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a small mug or coffee cup, mix cocoa and granulated sugar substitute together. Add a few tablespoons of coffee and stir until cocoa is completely dissolved. Pour in remaining coffee."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Foam milk. Spoon a generous amount over hot mocha. Garnish with a pinch of cocoa powder, if desired."
    }
  ],
